# ==============================================================================
# Kalya Monorepo — Docker Ignore File (.dockerignore)
# Place at the root of the repository (where docker context is '.')
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Dependencies (Crucial: never send host node_modules to Linux container)
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
.pnpm-store

# 2. Build Artifacts & Caches
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# 3. Version Control & Git
**/.git
**/.github
.git

# 4. Environment Secrets (Never bake secrets into container images)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# 5. Local Databases & File Uploads (Avoid baking local test data into image)
**/data
**/data/*
**/uploads
**/uploads/*
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm

# 6. Logs & Diagnostics
**/logs
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# 7. OS & IDE Metadata
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# 8. Temporary Reference Files & Scratch Notes
client.txt
server.txt
ui.txt
commit_message.txt
setup.md
UI.md
.agents
.claude
.gemini
